        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felix Salten\n- Works: Bambi, a Life in the Woods\n- Places: Vienna, Austria\n- Companies: Ullstein Verlag\n\nFacts:\n- Felix Salten was born on 6 September 1869 and died on 8 October 1945.\n- Felix Salten was an Austrian author and critic in Vienna.\n- In 1923, Felix Salten wrote the Austrian novel Bambi, a Life in the Woods.\n- Bambi, a Life in the Woods was originally published in Austria as Bambi: Eine Lebensgeschichte aus dem Walde.\n- Ullstein Verlag published Bambi, a Life in the Woods.",
